---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Us — Mission, Vision & Values">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFB800]">Who We Are</span>
    <h1 class="font-['Exo_2'] font-extrabold text-4xl sm:text-5xl mt-2">About TF Unions</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      TF Unions (originally founded as <strong>Altafawwoq Union</strong>) is an independent, non-profit educational ecosystem dedicated to helping ambitious and standout students across Egypt achieve science, technology, engineering, mathematics (STEM), research, and innovation goals.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-6">
      <div class="bg-[#0C1636] border-l-4 border-[#FFB800] rounded-r-2xl p-6 border-y border-r border-white/10">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFB800]">Mission</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
          Our mission is to provide students with the knowledge, tools, and opportunities they need — even before they realize the questions they should be asking.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#0C1636] border-l-4 border-[#FFB800] rounded-r-2xl p-6 border-y border-r border-white/10">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFB800]">Vision</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
          Our vision is to become the most trusted and impactful community for ambitious students in Egypt, building sustainable open-access services that reduce barriers regardless of a student’s governorate or school system.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#0C1636] border-l-4 border-[#FFB800] rounded-r-2xl p-6 border-y border-r border-white/10">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFB800]">Values</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
          Our values center around building a supportive family for all students. We believe that <strong>"زكاة العلم نشره"</strong> — sharing knowledge is a responsibility, and standout students are defined by curiosity, initiative, and perseverance rather than grades alone.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 bg-[#0C1636] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8">
      <h2 class="font-['Exo_2'] font-bold text-2xl">Open to Every Educational System</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        You do <strong>not</strong> need to attend a STEM school to benefit from TF Unions. Whether you study in Thanaweya Amma, STEM High Schools, Azhar, IGCSE, American Diploma, Preparatory School, or University, a single TF Unions Passport gives you equal access to every service we build.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex gap-4">
        <a href="/charter" class="text-xs font-bold text-[#FFB800] hover:underline">Read the Organizational Charter →</a>
        <a href="/team" class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-300 hover:underline">Meet the Founders &amp; Contributors →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
